29-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001","text":"長子堅，字長白。大同元年，以例封汝南侯，邑五百戶。亦善草隸，性頗庸短。侯景圍城，堅屯太陽門，終日蒲飲，不撫軍政。吏士有功，未嘗申理，疫癘所加，亦不存卹，士咸憤怨。太清三年三月，堅書佐董勛華、白曇朗等以繩引賊登樓，城遂陷，堅遇害。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":57,"last_line":57,"raw_start":4950,"raw_end":5078,"raw_character_offsets":[4950,4951,4952,4953,4954,4955,4956,4957,4963,4964,4965,4966,4969,4970,4971,4972,4973,4974,4975,4976,4977,4978,4979,4980,4981,4982,4983,4984,4985,4986,4987,4988,4989,4990,4991,4992,4993,4994,4995,4996,4997,4998,4999,5000,5001,5002,5003,5004,5005,5006,5007,5008,5009,5010,5011,5012,5013,5014,5015,5016,5017,5018,5019,5020,5021,5022,5023,5024,5025,5026,5027,5028,5029,5030,5031,5032,5033,5034,5035,5036,5037,5043,5044,5045,5046,5049,5050,5051,5052,5053,5054,5055,5056,5057,5058,5059,5060,5061,5062,5063,5064,5065,5066,5067,5068,5069,5070,5071,5072,5073,5074,5075,5076,5077],"revision_id":1538079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"81y_7i5_frc_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"長白","kind":"person","person_id":"81y_7i5_frc_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"侯景","kind":"person","person_id":"5d1_8jg_amy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"81y_7i5_frc_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"81y_7i5_frc_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"董勛華","kind":"person","person_id":"ebk_gw2_08z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0095","start":95,"end":98,"surface":"白曇朗","kind":"person","person_id":"wcr_6t1_ti8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001:m0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"81y_7i5_frc_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque-ws1538079"},{"id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaolun-sons-brothers:p001","text":"長子堅字長白，大同元年，以例封汝南侯。亦善草隸，性頗庸短，嘗與所親書，題云：「嗣王」。其人得書大駭，執以諫堅，堅曰：「前言戲耳。」人曰：「不願以此為戲耳。」侯景圍城，堅屯太陽門，終日蒱飲，不撫軍政。吏士有功，未嘗申理，疫癘所加，亦不存恤，士咸憤怨。太清三年，堅書佐董勳華、白曇朗等以堅私室醞釀，亟有烹宰，不相沾及，忿恨，夜遣賊登樓，城遂陷，堅遇害。弟確。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":128,"last_line":128,"raw_start":10000,"raw_end":10177,"raw_character_offsets":[10000,10001,10002,10003,10004,10005,10006,10007,10008,10009,10010,10011,10012,10013,10014,10015,10016,10017,10018,10019,10020,10021,10022,10023,10024,10025,10026,10027,10028,10029,10030,10031,10032,10033,10034,10035,10036,10037,10038,10039,10040,10041,10042,10043,10044,10045,10046,10047,10048,10049,10050,10051,10052,10053,10054,10055,10056,10057,10058,10059,10060,10061,10062,10063,10064,10065,10066,10067,10068,10069,10070,10071,10072,10073,10074,10075,10076,10077,10078,10079,10080,10081,10082,10083,10084,10085,10086,10087,10088,10089,10090,10091,10092,10093,10094,10095,10096,10097,10098,10099,10100,10101,10102,10103,10104,10105,10106,10107,10108,10109,10110,10111,10112,10113,10114,10115,10116,10117,10118,10119,10120,10121,10122,10123,10124,10125,10126,10127,10128,10129,10130,10131,10132,10133,10134,10135,10136,10137,10138,10139,10140,10141,10142,10143,10144,10145,10146,10147,10148,10149,10150,10151,10152,10153,10154,10155,10156,10157,10158,10159,10160,10161,10162,10163,10164,10165,10166,10167,10168,10169,10170,10171,10172,10173,10174,10175,10176],"revision_id":1518868},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaolun-sons-brothers:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"堅","kind":"person",